{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"“Alright, I left the note to you Leaf because I was going to meet with Ebuc in secret to have him look over the contract. I wasn’t sure what would happen if it was looked into using his ‘science’, so I wanted to have someone I could trust come in and check to make sure we were okay. As Ebuc and I were talking. Castor, Amara, and Rah came saying that you needed to talk to me” copper points to Wynn, “I go with them to Castors room. Castor and I enter, while Rah and Amara waited outside. Through our conversation, I realized that the time would almost be up for you, Leaf, to check on me, and I didn’t want you to worry to find the room empty. So I convinced Castor to go with me to my room. As we step out, i expected Rahvioli and Amara to follow us, however they didn’t. So maybe Amara was the last to see him alive? Maybe she can help us find out what happened to him after that.”","created_at":"2020-07-26T20:17:13.898000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-26T20:17:45.315000Z","id":"737040857135316992","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
